{"direction":"server","message":{"method":"item/completed","params":{"item":{"type":"plan","id":"01a1887e-d8d7-7dc0-b706-30047b2d8629-plan","text":"# Add a short README\n\n## Summary\nCreate a concise `README.md` at the project root, following your choice of **short**.\n\n## Changes\n- Use “Project” as the title because no project name is defined.\n- Add a brief description stating that this is a new project awaiting implementation.\n- Include a “Getting started” section explaining that setup and usage instructions will be added once code exists.\n- Leave the existing `plan.txt` unchanged. No API or interface changes are needed.\n\n## Validation\n- Confirm `README.md` exists and renders correctly as Markdown.\n- Check that it contains no invented commands, dependencies, or functionality.\n\n## Assumptions\n- Keep the README under 150 words.\n- Defer license and contribution guidance until those policies are defined.\n"},"threadId":"01a1887e-d8cc-7981-bab1-7f665ae400c4","turnId":"01a1887e-d8d7-7dc0-b706-30047b2d8629","completedAtMs":1793291396216},"emittedAtMs":1793291396219}}
